'''Leeches''' are flying monsters introduced in the vanilla content of ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth]]''.

Similar to {{e|Charger}}s, if Isaac lines up with a Leech horizontally or vertically, the Leech will quickly charge towards him. Leeches do a full heart of contact damage.

{{dlc|r}} Leeches and their variants are immune to knockback.

