=== Kamikaze Leech ===
'''Kamikaze Leeches''' are a unique type of Leech with an eye in their mouth. They are introduced in the vanilla content of ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth]]'' and commonly found in {{s|Sheol}} but can appear elsewhere such as {{s|Necropolis}} and {{s|Dark Room}}.

These behave similarly to normal Leeches, but explode upon death. They can be spawned by a couple of bosses, such as {{e|Satan}}'s second form; as well, two of these will also appear to either side of {{e|The Fallen}} during the first phase of this battle.
{{clear}}

