'''Holy Leeches''' are white-colored variants of the Kamikaze Leech commonly found in the {{s|Cathedral}}, but can occasionally appear in {{s|Utero}}.

These behave similarly to Kamikaze Leeches, but have an {{e|Eternal Fly}} circling them. Because the Holy Leech explodes upon death, the Eternal Fly will die instantly and only serves to block projectiles.
