== Trivia ==
* Kamikaze Leech was first added in the Halloween update for the original Flash version of ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* Holy Leech was first added in the original Flash game's ''Wrath of the Lamb'' DLC.
* The Leech's charging sound effect is, in reality, a man saying "EHHH" sped up. This can be revealed by listening to the attack sound of a [[Champion|Large Champion]] Leech.
* {{dlc|r}} The [[Anti:Small Leech|Small Leech]] and [[Anti:Adult Leech|Adult Leech]] first appeared in the fan DLC ''Antibirth''.
** The Adult Leech's design is from a mockup for a Corpse altfloor by artist NotYourSagittarius created in February 2015.<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/2veccu/enemy_ideas/</ref>

